ceActivity.md","line":34},{"title":"MID Server","target":"mid-server-landing","line":34},{"title":"Workflow Editor","target":"workflow-editor","line":36},{"title":"IP address","target":"ip-address","line":89},{"title":"REST web service activity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/orchestration/t_CreateARESTWebServiceActivity.md","line":102},{"title":"REST web service activity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/orchestration/t_CreateARESTWebServiceActivity.md","line":199},{"title":"REST web service activity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/orchestration/t_CreateARESTWebServiceActivity.md","line":288},{"title":"reference","target":"reference","line":343},{"title":"REST web service activity","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/orchestration/t_CreateARESTWebServiceActivity.md","line":358},{"title":"List DNS C-records activity","target":"r_ListDNSCRecordsActivity-1","line":423},{"title":"MID Server","target":"mid-server-landing","line":424},{"title":"Workflow editor","target":"workflow-editor","line":425},{"title":"IP Address","target":"ip-address","line":426},{"title":"Reference","target":"reference","line":427}],"metadata":{"title":"Infoblox DNS activities","description":"The Infoblox DNS activities manage DNS records in your network using an Infoblox DDI Grid Server.The List DNS C-records activity retrieves all canonical \\(CNAME\\) records from a specified Infoblox server.The Register DNS A-record activity creates a DNS A record on a specified Infoblox server.The Register DNS C-Record activity creates a DNS canonical \\(CNAME\\) record on a specified Infoblox server.The List DNS Record activity generates a list of all the DNS entries on a specific InfoBlox server.The DNS Delete activity deletes DNS records of any type from in Infoblox server, such as C and A records.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/servicenow-platform/orchestration/c\\_InfobloxDNSActivities.html","release":"australia","product":"Orchestration","classification":"orchestration","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":7,"breadcrumb":["Infoblox DDI activity pack","Orchestration activity packs","Classic Orchestration","ServiceNow AI Platform Additional Capabilities","Extend ServiceNow AI Platform capabilities"],"tags":["#servicenow-platform","#orchestration","#itpa","#automation","#runbooks","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/servicenow-platform/orchestration/c_InfobloxDNSActivities.md"},
